WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.405
Week 35: Analysis, Argument, and Professional Listening. identify main idea and supporting detail defend an opinion summarize unfamiliar material

2
00:00:10.405 --> 00:00:18.015
Form and meaning. Synthesis of mood, tense, reference, cohesion, qualification, and formal argument structure.

3
00:00:18.015 --> 00:00:53.019
Model set. El argumento principal se apoya en tres hallazgos. Cabe destacar que la muestra fue pequeña. Aunque la propuesta tiene ventajas, su alcance es limitado. La consecuencia más probable sería un aumento gradual. En conclusión, recomiendo una prueba controlada. The main argument is supported by three findings. It is worth noting that the sample was small. Although the proposal has advantages, its scope is limited. The most likely consequence would be a gradual increase. In conclusion, I recommend a controlled trial.

4
00:00:53.019 --> 00:01:03.149
Contrastive practice. Change the person, time, number, or level of formality in each model. Preserve the communicative purpose while the grammar changes.

5
00:01:03.149 --> 00:01:17.354
Production check. Say one original sentence for each function: identify main idea and supporting detail; defend an opinion; summarize unfamiliar material. Then write it and compare the spoken and written forms.

6
00:01:17.354 --> 00:01:53.233
Model language. El argumento principal se apoya en tres hallazgos. — The main argument is supported by three findings. Cabe destacar que la muestra fue pequeña. — It is worth noting that the sample was small. Aunque la propuesta tiene ventajas, su alcance es limitado. — Although the proposal has advantages, its scope is limited. La consecuencia más probable sería un aumento gradual. — The most likely consequence would be a gradual increase. En conclusión, recomiendo una prueba controlada. — In conclusion, I recommend a controlled trial.

7
00:01:53.233 --> 00:02:02.982
Check your readiness. Explain the core idea. Produce an original example. Complete the section assessment at 85% or higher.
